{"ID":"20240205153638-3ja9pba","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153638-3ja9pba","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153638-3ja9pba\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206135425-zuvbfaz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612085411-6q939i3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:898,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612085605-7irei51\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"205桑根白皮（桑白皮）","type":"doc","updated":"20240821085008"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206135425-zuvbfaz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135425-zuvbfaz","updated":"20240206135428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产浙江、江苏、安徽、湖南、四川等地。\n【性状】\t长片状槽状形，左右两边向内卷曲，卷边呈半筒形，槽的中呈长而扭曲的板片状，筒状或两边向内卷成槽状，长短宽窄不一，厚0.1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"0.5cm。外表面淡黄白色，有少数棕黄色或红棕色斑点 (残留栓皮)，内表面黄白色或灰黄色，平滑，有细纵纹，有的纵向裂开，露出纤维。体轻质韧，难折断，易纵向撕裂，撕裂时有白色粉尘飞出，气微，味微甜。\n【性味】\t甘，寒。\n【功效】\t泻肺平喘，利水消肿。用于肺热咳喘，面目浮肿，小便不利等症。\n【炙品】\t蜜炙桑白皮：炙桑白皮取桑白皮丝片，用炼蜜 (桑白皮100kg，用炼蜜25kg，适量开水稀释) 拌匀，稍闷，以文火炒至金黄色不粘手时，取出摊凉。蜜炙后缓和寒泻之性，增强润肺止咳作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240206135418-7f3kwyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206135418-7f3kwyc","updated":"20240206135418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206135418-846d1sj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205164307-osg5roh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205164307-osg5roh","updated":"20240205164307"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑白皮"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑白皮-20240205164307-gld4bqm.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626080936-ie78aqd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626080936-ie78aqd","updated":"20240715131939"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 303px;","style":"width: 293px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240626080936-m9m5h49.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 293px;\" parent-style=\"width: 303px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"桑葚"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/桑葚-20240715131939-gxk77fp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 528px;","style":"width: 518px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240221194320-jduqpx8.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 518px;\" parent-style=\"width: 528px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240626081526-8pp6zg0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240626081526-8pp6zg0","updated":"20240626081922"}